    "chunk_text": "bianis gehaten, on hetelicum wintra, on swa swi\u00f0licum \u00dea gemette he \u00f0\u00e6r \u00e6nne \u00feearfan nacodne, biddende \u00fea riddan \u00fe\u00e6t hi him sum reaf sealdon; ac hi ridon Martinus \u00fea ongeat \u00fe\u00e6t he moste his helpan, \u00fea \u00f0a \u00fea o\u00fere noldon, ac he nyste swa\u00feeah hw\u00e6t he sealde He gel\u00e6hte \u00f0a his sex, and forcearf his basing, and sealde healfne d\u00e6l \u00feam ges\u00e6ligan \u00feearfan, and \u00feone \u00dea hlogon his geferan \u00fe\u00e6s forcorfenan basinges, sume eac besargodon \u00fe\u00e6t hi swilces naht ne dydon, On \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan nihte he geseah on swefne \u00feone H\u00e6lend gescrydne mid \u00feam healfan basinge, \u00fee he \u00de\u00e6rrihte gehyrde se halga Martinus \u00feone H\u00e6lend clypian to his halgum englum mid beorhtre stemne, He gemunde \u00fea his cwydes \u00fee he cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his godspelle, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ge do\u00f0 on minum naman anum of Se halga wer swa\u00feeah n\u00e6s ahafen \u00feurh \u00fea gesih\u00fee, ac Godes godnysse he oncneow on his weorce. And \u00fea \u00fea he w\u00e6s eahtatyne wintre, he wear\u00f0 gefullod on Gode, nolde \u00feeah git forl\u00e6tan, for his leofan Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a f\u00e6rlice wear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s fyrlenan leodscipes onr\u00e6s into Gallias, and Iulianus se casere gegaderode \u00dea wende Martinus \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea wel mihte wilnian \u00e6t \u00feam casere \u00fe\u00e6t he of \u00feam campdome \u00fea cuman Him ne \u00f0uhte na fremfullic \u00fe\u00e6t he f",
